{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish","id":1278280,"title":"Agape, Familiar Fish","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-03T03:27:04-08:00","id":1278280,"title":"Agape, Familiar Fish","content":"Theodotus's familiar, he likes cooking but hates hunting so like a normal sorcerer, he made a tuna fish that is re-eatable.<br /> <br /> I should have made a pig for 2019, but technically Lunar New Year hasn't come yet so a fish is still fine ~<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <b><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\">Agape, Banquet Table Siren (3\u2022 Familiar)</span></span></b></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A witch created Agape to serve as their perfect ever-replenishing source of meats, though nobody knows why the witch imbue the fish with such sublime beauty, skin glistering with blue stripes like a summer ocean and golden scales decorated its fins with deep somber eyes that tells the love story of a sea hag noon witch. Agape can steal the heart of countless tyrants and fairies with just a seducing glance if it isn\u2019t already so madly in love with its creator, and thus the fish responds to any suitors with scaling curses and insults.</span></span></i> <br /> <br /> <b><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/vv_Y1VAvCUVCQmffbe_OlrKDK_JbN-OKmEOzBvt6t59IPGIgsQbV-HPy5dl9l8n0SkdwabAZ3RF9Aid_BQfvhQ92rGSibH7IzSS726fp8iVxLQVCRvWYvVBhDO5GNq-0a7ZB_uXk\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></b> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Essence:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3</span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">; Willpower: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">; Join Battle: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3 dice</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Personal Motes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">100</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Health Levels:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">-0 / -1 x 1 / -2 x 1 / -4 x 1 / Incap.</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Actions:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Swimming (6 dice), Sense (4 dice), Resisting Disease and Sickness: (8 dice), Being Cute (7 dice), Cursing: (10 dice)</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Appearance </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">8</span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resolve </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3</span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Guile </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attack (Bite):</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2 dice (Damage 1)</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Combat Movement:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10 dice</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Evasion </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">5</span></span><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Parry </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">1</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Soak/Hardness:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">3/2</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Sample Intimacies:</span></span></b><ul><li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Defining Principle: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201cI love to be eaten by master.\u201d</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Defining Tie: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Theodotus (Endless Infinity Bottomless Love)</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Major Principle: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201cTrue love can only be achieved with inner beauty.\u201d</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Major Tie: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Theodotus\u2019s Friends (Eager to please)</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Major Tie: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">People with cooking skill (Respect)</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Minor Principle: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">\u201cSunbathing with salt on my skin is so calming.\u201d</span></span></li> <li><b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Minor Tie: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Suitor (Annoyance)</span></span></li> </ul><br /> <b><b><span style=\"color:#cc0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><i><u>Merits</u></i></span></span></b></b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Thousand-Facet Tuna: </i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">By tasting the blood of a non-magical animal, Agape can transform its meat into the meat of such creature with a Miscellaneous action.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Two Worlds Grace: </i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Agape can swim through the air as if it\u2019s water and can breathe air without suffocating.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Heavenly Ingredient: </i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Agape\u2019s meat is never spoiled and combines perfectly with every other ingredient or method of cooking, the chef reroll every 1s on his Craft roll when preparing a meal using Agape\u2019s meat.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Fish Spring Eternal:</i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">As long as Agape\u2019s bone still existed, it can be resurrected by burying the bone into the ground and spring water onto the spot. The fish will grow back into its normal form after a day has passed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><b><span style=\"color:#cc0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><i><u>Defensive Charms</u></i></span></span></b></b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Fish Soul, Sun Bod (</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10m,1wp; Reflexive, Instant</span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>): </i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A spark of its Solar creator is imbued within Agape\u2019s body, allowing the fish to increase its soak to 20 and hardness to 10. This charm can only be used once per scene unless Agape crashes another opponent.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><b><span style=\"color:#cc0000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><i><u>Social Charms</u></i></span></span></b></b><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Elegant Psari Slander </i></span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>(</i>5m; Reflexive, Instant): Hurling insults after insults, Agape wears down the enemy mental health. Roll 10 dices against the opponent's Resolve whom is inflicted with a negative tie toward themselves if they fail to resist. The lost of confidence also cause them to lose 5i (and an additional 1i for each threshold success on Agape\u2019s roll), if this lead to the opponent to enter crash then the negative tie increases to one tier, if it\u2019s already at the Defining level the opponent can\u2019t leave crash for the rest of the scene.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>First Hook Impression (</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">10m, 1wp; Reflexive, Indefinite): </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Anyone who meets Agape for the first time must roll their Resolve against an inspire action, if Agape successes then the target receives a minor Intimacy of platonic love toward the fish that can\u2019t be eroded as long as he can see Agape. Furthermore, he can suppress his other romantic Intimacies without paying Willpower or receiving Limit.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Sun Siren Ways (</i></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">4m; Reflexive, Instant): </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Agape can add 4 dice to any social rolls, if the target is already inflicted with Elegant Psari Slander then the roll is also benefited from double 9s.</span></span></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 01-03-2019, 06:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T06:39:07-08:00","id":1278307,"title":"","content":"Interesting. And adorable.<br /> <br /> I like how the picture is overall simple, but finely detailed.<br /> <br /> Is Agape based on anything folkloric, or purely your own creation?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T07:23:12-08:00","id":1278315,"title":"","content":"Interesting<br /> <br /> If it could regen its flesh faster than a day, then it'd be a 4 dot familiar - because then you could farm it to feed larger groups of people, making it a very potent mobile source of military meat fuel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T08:05:09-08:00","id":1278318,"title":"","content":"I actually super love this.<br /> <br /> However, given the social charms, he should probably have a Social Influence die pool in his list of actions, unless &quot;Being Cute&quot; <b>is</b> his social pool. At least an Inspire pool.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T19:28:23-08:00","id":1278484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278307#post1278307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is Agape based on anything folkloric, or purely your own creation?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, the Zenith has a fish and sea theme so I want a fish as his familiar, I come up with most of the write-up on my own, but the burial part is stolen from a folktale in my country where the protagonist buries the bone of her magical fishes in the earth and they get resurrected the next day (or turned into treasures depend on which version).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278318#post1278318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually super love this.<br /> <br /> However, given the social charms, he should probably have a Social Influence die pool in his list of actions, unless &quot;Being Cute&quot; <b>is</b> his social pool. At least an Inspire pool.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, being cute is indeed his social pool, since I can't find a way to fit that character trait into the description so I stuffed it in the action pool instead. Though that maybe a bad idea since it looks very confusing...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":298,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","user":"Jen","date":". 01-03-2019, 10:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T03:37:31-08:00","id":1278530,"title":"","content":"Are the suitors proposing to Agape's creator, or to Agape?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T07:28:38-08:00","id":1278577,"title":"","content":"I find its characteristics to be effectively reminiscent of folklore. I also like it having a straightforward inhuman Principle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T08:24:16-08:00","id":1278596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278484#post1278484\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, the Zenith has a fish and sea theme so I want a fish as his familiar, I come up with most of the write-up on my own, but the burial part is stolen from a folktale in my country where the protagonist buries the bone of her magical fishes in the earth and they get resurrected the next day (or turned into treasures depend on which version).</div> </div> </div> </div>What's the title/character of the legend? Agape is one of several words for Love in Ancient Greek, specifically selfless, non-possessive, compassionate love. The New Testament uses it as the term for god's love for his creation, so that made me think of the feeding of the five thousand with five loaves and two fish.<br /> <br /> Anyway, I love it. I've long had the idea in my campaign of a people fleeing some great calamity in the distant east arriving at the western end of the Dreaming Sea, an entire nation of refugees afloat led by a Zenith who believes herself the one true Voice of the Most High. But what do they eat? Now I have an answer, and hopefully a fun NPC!<br /> <br /> Also, the fish is a master of Dreaming Pearl Courtesan Style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12943-handigar","name":"Handigar","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"33"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T10:11:33-08:00","id":1278621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epee102</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278530#post1278530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Are the suitors proposing to Agape's creator, or to Agape?</div> </div> </div> </div>It mostly annoyed toward its suitors, since the creator made sure that his familiar won't try to murder his future husband.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278577#post1278577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I find its characteristics to be effectively reminiscent of folklore. I also like it having a straightforward inhuman Principle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ooh, his master is a sorcerer so I want something weird for a familiar, so a fish that screams &quot;Eat me, master!&quot; seems like a good idea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Handigar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278596#post1278596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's the title/character of the legend? Agape is one of several words for Love in Ancient Greek, specifically selfless, non-possessive, compassionate love. The New Testament uses it as the term for god's love for his creation, so that made me think of the feeding of the five thousand with five loaves and two fish.</div> </div> </div> </div>The story is named T\u1ea5m C\u00e1m and T\u1ea5m is the girl's name. And I go with Agape since the creator is from not-Greek so I want a Greek name, plus the fish make people love it in a kind of non-sexualized way, and Platonic doesn't sound really good as name so it has to be Agape instead.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T10:29:41-08:00","id":1278628,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1278280-agape-familiar-fish?p=1278621#post1278621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ooh, his master is a sorcerer so I want something weird for a familiar, so a fish that screams &amp;quot;Eat me, master!&amp;quot; seems like a good idea.</div> </div> </div> </div>If this is referring to my Principle comment, I was actually thinking more about the sunbathing one.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, for the folkloric elements, it's the whole package: the wanting to provide flesh, the rebirth from a buried bone, the way it talks to other people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}